<p>Okay so I have two big concerns here. The first is that narratively, it feels like this is very similar to <a href="/scp-4645">SCP-4645</a> in style; down to the like, random blackmail claims and the unclear like, requirement for what the foundation should do.</p>
<p>The second is that this doesn't really go anywhere: you introduce the mystery of who is sending this and that the blackmail changes repeatedly but it doesn't go anywhere. Like, the foundation doesn't investigate who sent it, they don't really debate whether to accede to the demands, they don't refuse and have progressively worse things happen; so it just feels very&#8230;flat?</p>
